OL,3,GNEWSAChicken farm approved despite
OL,4,Alocal opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a chicken farm in
OL,7,FLincolnshire have been approved despite
OL,8,Fenvironmental concerns.
OL,10,FRH-J Farms had applied to build four
OL,11,Fpoultry units on land north-east of
OL,12,FGrange Farm Yard, in Toynton St Peter,
OL,13,Fnear Spilsby.
OL,15,FCommunities Against Factory Farming
OL,16,F(CAFF) submitted a formal objection to
OL,17,Fthe proposal, raising concerns about
OL,18,Fthe impact on the environment and the
OL,19,Fwelfare of the chickens.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
